WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.800
Hours of footage to dig through... before you even start editing.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Meet Flowmaster.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.300
Just record, and do your thing.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.900
Something good happens? Tap one key, and it's marked.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.900
Stop, and Flowmaster keeps just those moments.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.600
Hours in. Minutes out.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:39.000
Want more control? Choose exactly how much to keep around every mark.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.900
Or, take it to your editor. Every mark is already on the timeline.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.100
Out of space again?

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.900
Reclaim the space. Flowmaster finds the originals you've already clipped.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.500
And coming soon...

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:13.800
Events. Flowmaster scans the pixels on your screen.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.800
And Flow, your AI editing buddy.

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.400
Flow suggests. You decide.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.900
Mark it. Clip it. Clean it.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.600
Flowmaster. Edit as you record.
